  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-114288",
      "knowledge_point_id": "abe88143-989a-5967-bb08-16804e31d948",
      "knowledge_point": "Using Integration by Parts to Compute an Indefinite Integral Containing an Exponential Expression",
      "problem": "$\\int 4x{e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x=$",
      "worked_solution": "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 4x{e}^{8x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=4x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=4 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{8x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{1}{8}{e}^{8x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 4x\\cdot {e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x & =4x\\cdot \\frac{1}{8}{e}^{8x}-\\int \\frac{1}{8}{e}^{8x}\\cdot 4\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 4x{e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}x{e}^{8x}-\\frac{1}{2}\\int {e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{16}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{4}+C",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{4}+\\frac{5{e}^{8x}}{16}+C",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{8}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{16}+C",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{16}+C",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{3x{e}^{8x}}{8}+\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{12}+C",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
